<title>USA: Corestates unit files $677 mln shelf debt.</title>
<headline>Corestates unit files $677 mln shelf debt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corestates Bank N.A., a unit of Corestates Financial Corp, filed on Thursday a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission for up to $676.96 million in home equity loan certificates.</p>
<p>The offering includes $123.042 million of certificates previously registered with the SEC.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes, according to the filing.</p>
</text>
